WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:41.040 --> 01:43.000
Since everyone values us so much,

01:43.080 --> 01:44.800
I won't decline any further.

01:44.880 --> 01:48.360
The Xuantian Sect will do its utmost
to safeguard the Chaos Pearl.

01:50.200 --> 01:52.280
-Congratulations, Alliance Leader.
-Congratulations, Alliance Leader.

02:00.720 --> 02:02.480
Now that the new leader has been chosen,

02:03.080 --> 02:04.480
all sect leaders,

02:04.560 --> 02:07.600
please bring the jade tokens
to the Pearl Tower tomorrow at noon.

02:08.600 --> 02:12.000
At that time, The Snow City
will transfer the Chaos Pearl

02:12.080 --> 02:13.960
to the Xuantian Sect for safekeeping.

02:37.480 --> 02:39.760
My master's wish to become
the Alliance Leader has fallen through,

02:39.840 --> 02:41.280
so she must be furious.

02:41.840 --> 02:43.720
I'd better avoid her for now

02:43.800 --> 02:45.520
and wait until her anger cools off.

02:46.720 --> 02:48.320
As for the mistake
I made in helping the Dark Clan,

02:48.400 --> 02:50.600
Mu Xuanling and Xie Xuechen
haven't revealed it.

02:51.440 --> 02:53.000
They do have some sense of loyalty.

03:05.320 --> 03:09.720
Heartbroken in love,
strong in public, tears in private.

03:10.360 --> 03:12.360
Miss Gao is truly enduring.

03:16.200 --> 03:17.320
Miss Gao.

03:18.600 --> 03:19.800
Oh, Mr. Fu.

03:20.640 --> 03:21.920
What brings you here?

03:23.200 --> 03:26.880
Well, I accidentally
got some sand in my eyes.

03:26.960 --> 03:28.240
How embarrassing for you to see that.

03:29.360 --> 03:32.160
Using sand as an excuse
to hide her sorrow,

03:32.240 --> 03:33.960
she clearly doesn't want others
to look down on her.

03:34.040 --> 03:36.160
I shouldn't expose her.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.560
No worries. Let me blow it for you.

03:39.080 --> 03:39.920
Don't move. It will be fine.

03:40.000 --> 03:42.880
This time, you're smart enough
to understand what I mean.

03:43.400 --> 03:45.840
Saint Fajian may look young,

03:45.920 --> 03:47.720
but he's actually over 500 years old.

03:47.800 --> 03:49.240
He's quite advanced in age.

03:49.320 --> 03:51.080
Only by making him the leader

03:51.160 --> 03:54.480
can our son inherit the position sooner.

03:55.480 --> 03:58.320
Such simple calculations,
you don't need to remind me.

04:06.640 --> 04:07.880
Good boy!

04:19.320 --> 04:20.959
How did they get tangled up together?

04:21.040 --> 04:22.520
It's only been a few days,

04:22.600 --> 04:24.560
and our son's flirting habit is back.

04:25.080 --> 04:26.280
Who allowed you to criticize my son?

04:26.920 --> 04:28.840
He can flirt with whoever he wants.

04:29.360 --> 04:30.200
All right.

04:30.840 --> 04:32.080
But dear,

04:32.160 --> 04:34.600
our house is already filled with beauties.

04:34.680 --> 04:35.920
Isn't that enough for you?

04:36.000 --> 04:36.880
If this keeps up,

04:36.960 --> 04:38.800
my Jade Sky Palace
might as well be renamed

04:38.880 --> 04:39.920
"The House of Blossoms".

04:40.000 --> 04:41.960
That only proves our son's charm.

04:48.720 --> 04:49.800
Feeling better now?

04:53.080 --> 04:54.520
A bit better.

04:54.600 --> 04:55.440
Thank you, Mr. Fu.

04:56.240 --> 04:57.960
Didn't I act convincingly enough?

04:59.360 --> 05:00.320
By the way…

05:02.800 --> 05:05.160
My eye makeup…

05:06.680 --> 05:09.160
It isn't messed up.
You still look stunning.

05:12.480 --> 05:15.720
About yesterday… Did you resolve it?

05:17.920 --> 05:19.480
You mean the matter with Mu Xuanling?

05:19.560 --> 05:21.160
I gave her an artifact,

05:21.840 --> 05:23.600
so things should be settled
according to reason.

05:25.920 --> 05:29.200
A single artifact
can sever love and affection.

05:29.800 --> 05:32.360
Indeed, eternal love is a myth.

05:32.440 --> 05:33.840
But speaking of which,

05:33.920 --> 05:37.240
Gao Qiumin really meets the standards
of a young mistress.

05:38.080 --> 05:40.760
Too bad she's already spoken for,

05:40.840 --> 05:42.880
engaged to Mr. Xie, isn't she?

05:42.960 --> 05:44.080
Speaking of our son,

05:44.160 --> 05:47.080
how could he flirt with her
right under Mr. Xie's nose?

05:47.160 --> 05:49.360
If they find out,
the Jade Sky Palace will be disgraced.

05:49.440 --> 05:50.880
This child…

05:50.960 --> 05:51.880
So what?

05:52.520 --> 05:54.520
Don't say they're not married yet.

05:54.600 --> 05:57.160
Even if they were,
divorce is always an option.

05:57.240 --> 05:58.320
And what's wrong with remarrying?

05:58.400 --> 05:59.640
Wait. Are you implying something?

06:01.400 --> 06:03.280
Why does this sound
like a hint directed at me?

06:06.920 --> 06:09.200
Have you been planning
to divorce me all along?

06:12.600 --> 06:14.320
I never thought about it before,

06:14.960 --> 06:16.040
but now that you mention it…

06:16.120 --> 06:17.800
Duan Xiaorong, you…

06:20.400 --> 06:22.720
Alright, you're highly skilled.
Good for you!

06:22.800 --> 06:23.640
Fine,

06:23.720 --> 06:25.400
let's see who outlives the other.

06:25.480 --> 06:27.080
When you're old and bedridden,

06:27.160 --> 06:28.840
I'll… I'll cut off your medicine!

06:31.760 --> 06:33.160
Miss Gao, no need to be upset.

06:33.800 --> 06:35.640
If Mr. Xie has wronged you,

06:35.720 --> 06:37.360
then there's no reason
to cling to that engagement.

06:37.440 --> 06:38.800
Just find someone better.

06:38.880 --> 06:40.080
Wait a second!

06:40.600 --> 06:42.000
Who are you saying I'm engaged to?

06:42.840 --> 06:44.400
Miss Gao, no need to deny it.

06:44.480 --> 06:45.720
I understand everything.

06:45.800 --> 06:49.520
You're engaged to Mr. Xie,
but he's fallen for Miss Mu instead.

06:49.600 --> 06:50.600
It's truly heartbreaking.

06:50.680 --> 06:53.240
Stop! Don't talk nonsense!

06:53.320 --> 06:55.440
Who said I'm engaged to Xie Xuechen?

06:55.520 --> 06:57.720
I was wondering
why you've been acting so strange

06:57.800 --> 06:58.640
and constantly talking to me.

06:58.720 --> 07:00.240
Let me tell you, Mr. Fu,

07:00.320 --> 07:03.200
I'm not engaged to Xie Xuechen!

07:03.280 --> 07:06.640
He can like whoever he wants.
It's got nothing to do with me.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.000
Don't make assumptions!

07:10.040 --> 07:13.560
Besides, Xie Xuechen
isn't some reckless playboy.

07:13.640 --> 07:15.640
It's not nice to talk behind his back.

07:17.840 --> 07:19.360
How dare you!

07:27.480 --> 07:30.320
What lovely weather today,
sunny and bright!

07:31.400 --> 07:32.440
Quite pleasant.

07:33.000 --> 07:33.960
So, are you saying

07:35.000 --> 07:36.520
that the leaders,
elders, and trusted disciples

07:36.600 --> 07:37.840
of every sect in the Alliance
all have inner demons,

07:37.920 --> 07:41.080
making it impossible to tell
who has been possessed by the Dark Clan?

07:42.040 --> 07:43.360
Including the sect leaders,

07:43.440 --> 07:45.600
my master, and even…

07:46.200 --> 07:47.400
you, Mr. Xie.

07:49.320 --> 07:52.520
Regarding this conclusion,
I can't determine if it's true or not.

07:55.400 --> 07:59.000
Since yesterday until today,
have you noticed anything unusual?

08:01.080 --> 08:02.160
Unusual?

08:03.360 --> 08:04.400
Yes.

08:04.960 --> 08:05.800
What kind of unusual?

08:06.840 --> 08:10.600
I don't want to jump to conclusions
and would rather investigate further.

08:35.280 --> 08:37.039
Do you think he will find anything?

08:38.200 --> 08:39.280
Probably not,

08:40.080 --> 08:41.440
but it doesn't matter.

08:42.039 --> 08:43.480
After all, today's meditative observation

08:44.240 --> 08:46.520
is meant to make
those in the shadows think

08:46.600 --> 08:47.880
we've run out of options.

08:52.040 --> 08:53.800
Still, I'm a little curious.

08:54.480 --> 08:57.120
Does our Mr. Xie truly have inner demons?

08:57.200 --> 08:59.480
You weren't
in the Hall of Integrity earlier,

09:00.040 --> 09:03.200
so I'm also curious.
Does Mr. Nan have inner demons as well?

09:09.280 --> 09:11.360
Tomorrow is the handover
of the Chaos Pearl.

09:13.680 --> 09:14.640
Are you ready?

09:15.240 --> 09:17.120
There's no perfect plan in this world,

09:18.440 --> 09:20.000
only our best effort.

09:24.720 --> 09:26.160
As always…

09:28.400 --> 09:29.240
don't die.

09:48.640 --> 09:49.480
Master.

09:50.760 --> 09:54.240
You've never cared
about material things since childhood.

09:54.320 --> 09:56.760
Even if your clothes were torn,
you wouldn't think to mend them.

10:00.480 --> 10:02.560
If I weren't here,
who would look after you?

10:06.760 --> 10:08.640
What is it? Do you have something to say?

10:10.440 --> 10:11.280
Yes.

10:11.840 --> 10:12.760
Then sit down and speak.

10:30.480 --> 10:32.280
Master, was the seal
you gave me last night

10:33.000 --> 10:34.200
really just a seal?

10:35.520 --> 10:38.680
You little rascal,
are you doubting your master now?

10:39.280 --> 10:41.600
When you have doubts in your heart,
you must clarify them.

10:43.200 --> 10:44.840
Otherwise, once doubt arises,

10:45.360 --> 10:49.000
even the strongest dam
can collapse overnight.

10:50.040 --> 10:51.280
This is something you taught me.

10:51.360 --> 10:53.240
I didn't teach you
how to annoy me, though.

10:57.640 --> 10:58.840
To answer your question,

10:59.360 --> 11:00.880
the seal is just a seal.

11:01.400 --> 11:02.520
No tricks were involved.

11:03.120 --> 11:05.000
If the seal truly is just a seal,

11:05.880 --> 11:07.680
then what is your obsession, Master?

11:11.120 --> 11:12.640
If you must know my obsession,

11:13.240 --> 11:15.720
it is simply to see our sect leader
become the Alliance Leader.

11:17.280 --> 11:18.440
Now that my wish has come true,

11:19.960 --> 11:21.920
there's nothing left to dwell on.

11:23.080 --> 11:25.040
Do you believe my words?

11:25.880 --> 11:26.880
I do.

11:30.760 --> 11:34.080
Sometimes, though, I feel
I've taught you to be too pure,

11:34.800 --> 11:36.480
making you easily deceived.

11:38.600 --> 11:41.480
But a lesson learned
from failure is still worthwhile.

11:43.160 --> 11:44.560
Among all my disciples,

11:45.160 --> 11:48.640
only you have achieved detachment

11:48.720 --> 11:50.360
without consciously striving for it.

11:51.880 --> 11:54.040
Detachment brings freedom
from inner demons.

11:56.040 --> 11:57.080
Xuanxin,

11:58.400 --> 12:00.760
your level has already surpassed mine.

12:05.320 --> 12:07.280
HALL OF HERITAGE

12:07.360 --> 12:08.480
Since the new
Alliance Leader has been chosen,

12:09.720 --> 12:12.000
the Chaos Pearl
will be handed over tomorrow.

12:12.960 --> 12:15.160
Though you've only been
in the sect a short time,

12:15.760 --> 12:18.000
the upcoming threat of the Dark Clan

12:18.080 --> 12:20.560
requires us to strengthen our defenses.

12:20.640 --> 12:21.680
Tomorrow,

12:21.760 --> 12:25.480
you will accompany me to the Pearl Tower
and guard it together.

12:25.560 --> 12:27.040
-Understood!
-Understood!

12:32.560 --> 12:35.400
All right, you may all leave now.

12:40.000 --> 12:42.040
-See you, Elder.
-See you, Elder.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.520
-We shall leave.
-Let's leave.

12:44.600 --> 12:45.440
Mu Xuanling.

12:45.520 --> 12:47.240
-Well…
-The guardian duty

12:47.320 --> 12:49.280
-is indeed tough.
-When we are back,

12:49.360 --> 12:50.720
-how can we practice to be better?
-Indeed.

12:50.800 --> 12:53.160
-It is an important task.
-True.

13:06.840 --> 13:09.960
Look at yourself, lost in thought.

13:10.720 --> 13:12.880
Did you bother Mr. Xie
again in the middle of the night?

13:18.240 --> 13:19.840
What should I do with you?

13:20.440 --> 13:21.440
Don't think that just
because he protects you,

13:21.520 --> 13:23.120
I won't criticize you.

13:23.200 --> 13:25.160
These are dangerous times,
and threats are everywhere.

13:25.240 --> 13:26.400
Mr. Xie is busy,

13:26.480 --> 13:28.080
so can't you restrain yourself?

13:28.600 --> 13:30.360
Besides, you've got a heavy workload.

13:30.440 --> 13:32.600
Stop wasting time thinking about nonsense.

13:32.680 --> 13:33.760
Got it?

13:35.120 --> 13:36.080
Got it.

13:36.720 --> 13:38.440
Hearing it is one thing,
but doing it is another.

13:45.920 --> 13:49.400
Now go get some proper rest.
You'll need your energy.

13:50.720 --> 13:54.280
As a disciple of the Snow City,
you can't be so tired!

14:07.240 --> 14:08.080
Xuanling!

14:09.080 --> 14:10.360
Senior.

14:10.440 --> 14:13.320
Xuanling, I wanted to talk to you earlier,

14:13.400 --> 14:15.120
but Elder Cang was there.

14:16.120 --> 14:16.960
What's the matter?

14:17.040 --> 14:19.200
We're carrying out the mission tomorrow,

14:19.280 --> 14:20.600
and the enemy remains hidden.

14:20.680 --> 14:21.680
Who knows what might happen?

14:21.760 --> 14:23.120
So, stick close to me tomorrow.

14:23.200 --> 14:24.960
If anything happens, I'll protect you!

14:26.680 --> 14:27.600
By the way,

14:28.400 --> 14:29.560
this is an artifact I've saved up.

14:29.640 --> 14:31.280
It strengthens shields.

14:31.360 --> 14:32.680
Be sure to keep it with you.

14:34.760 --> 14:37.920
If I'm not mistaken,
you're younger than I.

14:38.000 --> 14:40.120
But I joined the sect earlier than you.

14:40.200 --> 14:41.400
You're the junior sister.

14:44.880 --> 14:47.840
Why did you join the Snow City?

14:50.360 --> 14:51.800
More than ten years ago,

14:51.880 --> 14:54.480
the barrier of the Immortals Array
developed a crack,

14:54.560 --> 14:57.400
and the Dark Clan emerged,
killing my entire village.

14:59.320 --> 15:02.280
So, you cultivate to seek revenge?

15:02.360 --> 15:03.280
No.

15:04.040 --> 15:06.560
Before they died, my parents said,
"Don't live with hatred."

15:06.640 --> 15:08.000
Hatred can also nurture the Dark Clan.

15:09.800 --> 15:11.640
Let's not talk about this anymore.
I need to go prepare.

15:11.720 --> 15:13.040
You should go get ready too.

15:13.640 --> 15:15.080
Tomorrow is a big day.

15:15.160 --> 15:16.520
Take care. I'm off.

15:17.280 --> 15:20.800
HALL OF HERITAGE

15:26.720 --> 15:28.160
What a worthless artifact,

15:28.240 --> 15:29.840
though it's kind of cute.

15:34.360 --> 15:36.440
So, it turns out
Miss Gao has no interest in Mr. Xie,

15:37.040 --> 15:38.080
and they're not even engaged.

15:39.800 --> 15:40.800
I was even advising her

15:41.760 --> 15:45.360
not to be upset
over Mr. Xie's closeness with Miss Mu.

15:46.640 --> 15:50.640
In her eyes,
I must look like a complete fool.

15:53.440 --> 15:54.440
You seem to care so much.

15:55.160 --> 15:57.960
Could it be that you want
to be friends with Miss Gao?

15:58.560 --> 16:00.160
The more friends, the better.

16:05.520 --> 16:07.560
You're so kind to every girl.

16:08.400 --> 16:11.440
No wonder Master Fu says you're a playboy.

16:12.440 --> 16:13.720
He says that about me?

16:13.800 --> 16:15.520
Back in the day,
he relied on his handsome looks

16:15.600 --> 16:17.560
to flirt with everyone.

16:21.560 --> 16:22.520
But you,

16:23.600 --> 16:24.520
after all these years,

16:24.600 --> 16:26.080
are you still
searching for that dream girl?

16:29.480 --> 16:32.080
Maybe… I've already found her.

16:32.760 --> 16:33.600
You have?

16:33.680 --> 16:35.080
Which girl is it?

16:36.920 --> 16:38.760
It's just a feeling.

16:38.840 --> 16:39.840
I haven't confirmed it yet.

16:40.480 --> 16:42.000
Once you confirm, tell me immediately.

16:45.400 --> 16:48.800
Why are you even more anxious than I am?

16:48.880 --> 16:50.520
I'm just curious!

16:51.200 --> 16:52.520
Come on. Don't keep me waiting too long!

16:56.040 --> 16:57.760
I don't want to wait too long either.

17:05.599 --> 17:11.560
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

17:18.839 --> 17:20.800
The moon isn't even full tonight.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.240
What are you doing out here?

17:27.480 --> 17:28.600
When did you get here?

17:29.160 --> 17:30.680
Since the moon rose.

17:32.600 --> 17:33.480
Have you been here the whole time?

17:36.000 --> 17:37.640
Yes. I was thinking about something

17:39.200 --> 17:40.440
but unable to figure it out.

17:41.720 --> 17:43.000
What were you thinking about?

17:45.480 --> 17:48.360
Today, I went down the mountain
to a nearby town

17:49.280 --> 17:51.720
and sat in a teahouse by the street
all afternoon.

17:51.800 --> 17:52.760
Why?

17:55.680 --> 17:57.240
I wanted to see

17:57.920 --> 17:59.440
the world you're so determined to protect.

18:03.960 --> 18:05.200
And how was it?

18:07.600 --> 18:08.960
After sitting there all afternoon,

18:09.840 --> 18:12.160
I saw 32 couples walk by,

18:12.240 --> 18:13.600
-but only a few held hands.
-What are you looking at?

18:13.680 --> 18:15.920
-Why were you looking at other ladies?
-Five of them were arguing.

18:16.000 --> 18:17.720
At the food stalls,

18:17.800 --> 18:20.240
there were 123 customers in total.

18:20.880 --> 18:22.920
Nine children buying candied fruit skewers

18:23.480 --> 18:25.200
and ten elderly people
visiting the pharmacy.

18:25.840 --> 18:28.640
-The jeweler next door was a bit shady,
-Take it.

18:28.720 --> 18:29.880
selling the same hairpin

18:29.960 --> 18:32.160
-to one customer for 60 wen,
-I will have it.

18:32.240 --> 18:34.040
then to the next for 90 wen.

18:34.120 --> 18:35.280
-Ninety wen for it.
-No, I don't want it.

18:35.360 --> 18:37.000
-And then there was a gambling den nearby.
-I can offer a better price.

18:37.080 --> 18:37.920
CASINO

18:38.000 --> 18:39.520
Lots of people coming and going,

18:39.600 --> 18:41.440
but only a few left as winners.

18:41.520 --> 18:43.480
Three people who lost everything
were thrown out.

18:43.560 --> 18:44.520
If you've lost everything,
don't come back!

18:45.120 --> 18:46.440
There was also a petty thief

18:46.520 --> 18:48.360
who stole someone's life savings.

18:48.440 --> 18:49.440
TEA

18:49.520 --> 18:51.080
People came and went on the streets,

18:51.160 --> 18:54.600
but no one stepped forward
to help him in his despair.

18:54.680 --> 18:57.360
Xie Xuechen, I think it's not just you,

18:57.960 --> 18:59.720
the whole human world is utterly boring.

19:00.840 --> 19:02.480
Day after day,

19:02.560 --> 19:04.400
people hustle

19:04.480 --> 19:07.040
and bow their heads just for a few coins.

19:07.120 --> 19:09.160
The so-called promises of love

19:09.240 --> 19:10.960
fall apart under the weight
of daily struggles.

19:11.520 --> 19:13.760
Most couples grow to resent each other.

19:15.160 --> 19:17.880
Desires run wild,
and greed knows no bounds.

19:18.880 --> 19:21.600
Even knowing it's a trap,
people still jump in willingly.

19:23.440 --> 19:24.680
Good people

19:24.760 --> 19:27.440
don't always live to a ripe old age
to enjoy family blessings.

19:29.160 --> 19:31.720
Bad people don't always get
the punishment they deserve.

19:33.640 --> 19:34.760
In short,

19:35.360 --> 19:37.840
the world is harsh,
favoring the strong over the kind.

19:38.920 --> 19:40.280
The numb refuse to awaken,

19:41.640 --> 19:44.120
and those who awaken might not change.

19:44.800 --> 19:47.720
Even those who change
might not gain anything,

19:49.080 --> 19:52.400
and those who gain forget to cherish it.

20:04.600 --> 20:06.360
So, this is the conclusion
you've reached after an afternoon?

20:07.680 --> 20:11.160
The human world is dull, cold,
and trivial?

20:13.680 --> 20:15.200
And it deserves its fate.

20:28.360 --> 20:31.400
Don't think I'm not aware
of what you and Nan Xuyue are planning.

20:31.480 --> 20:32.440
You're in the open,

20:32.960 --> 20:34.880
while the Dark Clan and the Decaying
Immortal Pavilion hide in the shadows.

20:36.360 --> 20:39.720
If you don't seize the initiative,
you'll always remain passive.

20:40.560 --> 20:41.640
So,

20:41.720 --> 20:43.640
you want to use the Chaos Pearl handover

20:44.720 --> 20:46.320
to lure the enemy into the open,

20:47.480 --> 20:48.320
don't you?

20:49.920 --> 20:50.800
Yes.

20:53.920 --> 20:55.520
This time, Ignorance Demon will come.

20:56.320 --> 20:58.360
He's the cruelest of the Three Demons

21:00.040 --> 21:01.080
and a tough opponent.

21:03.440 --> 21:05.120
Tough or not, we have to face it.

21:05.200 --> 21:06.320
Xie Xuechen,

21:07.880 --> 21:10.960
will the Immortal Alliance
be stable after tomorrow?

21:13.320 --> 21:14.360
No.

21:14.440 --> 21:16.000
Will the human world become better?

21:16.720 --> 21:17.560
No.

21:17.640 --> 21:19.840
Then why are you still charging ahead?

21:19.920 --> 21:21.640
Why not just let them fend for themselves?

21:26.320 --> 21:27.320
Do you think

21:28.600 --> 21:30.040
the human world is a chaotic mess?

21:33.520 --> 21:34.840
Obviously.

21:34.920 --> 21:36.240
But amidst the chaos,

21:37.520 --> 21:38.800
haven't you seen even a sliver of hope?

21:41.840 --> 21:43.200
Just a tiny bit.

21:44.400 --> 21:46.080
What's the point of such fragile hope?

21:46.160 --> 21:49.600
Even a sliver of hope
is reason enough not to give up.

21:50.840 --> 21:53.960
Just like that day
when I brought you back here.

21:59.440 --> 22:02.160
Didn't you say
you wanted to leave the Dark Abyss

22:02.680 --> 22:04.240
and live an ordinary life?

22:04.320 --> 22:06.040
It's because I believed in that hope

22:07.000 --> 22:08.280
that I brought you back to the Snow City.

22:09.320 --> 22:12.320
Here, you can live
like an ordinary person,

22:12.960 --> 22:15.160
train with them, enjoy life,

22:15.960 --> 22:17.160
without killing and looting,

22:17.240 --> 22:19.640
brewing poison with flowers,
or sleeping with a blade at your side.

22:24.360 --> 22:27.080
Belief makes it possible.

22:29.360 --> 22:30.440
Mu Xuanling,

22:31.680 --> 22:34.000
you can't understand
the human world in half a day.

22:34.800 --> 22:36.200
Someday, if there's a chance,

22:37.520 --> 22:39.520
I'll show you the real human world.

22:46.840 --> 22:51.160
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

22:54.240 --> 22:57.160
Neither from ten years ago
nor now, ten years later,

22:58.720 --> 23:00.680
you haven't changed a bit.

23:02.360 --> 23:03.800
You're still foolish enough

23:04.840 --> 23:06.960
to sacrifice yourself for a stranger.

23:13.800 --> 23:14.880
Xie Xuechen,

23:16.560 --> 23:18.040
has anyone ever told you

23:18.840 --> 23:20.760
you live such an idealistic life?

23:24.120 --> 23:25.160
So idealistic it makes people want to…

23:26.440 --> 23:27.280
Want to what?

23:46.080 --> 23:47.240
Xie Xuechen,

23:48.400 --> 23:50.600
I want to go with you
to see the real human world.

23:56.040 --> 23:57.280
But unfortunately,

24:00.520 --> 24:02.280
if I protect your human world,

24:05.080 --> 24:07.120
I'll lose my future.

24:16.480 --> 24:17.320
Forget it.

24:18.440 --> 24:19.480
This cursed world…

24:21.600 --> 24:23.480
Let it have another chance.

24:37.080 --> 24:38.040
I'm off.

24:40.320 --> 24:41.320
See you tomorrow.

24:49.600 --> 24:52.080
Xie Xuechen, what's wrong with you?

24:52.760 --> 24:53.680
How could you…

24:55.800 --> 24:57.680
She seems a bit off today.

24:59.480 --> 25:00.480
Forget it.

25:01.200 --> 25:02.480
Let's talk after tomorrow

25:03.600 --> 25:05.160
if she's willing to tell me.

25:29.640 --> 25:30.920
The human world…

25:31.520 --> 25:32.600
hope…

25:33.680 --> 25:34.800
Xie Xuechen,

25:35.480 --> 25:39.400
the things you wish to protect,
I'll guard them for you this time.

25:40.560 --> 25:41.720
Sang Qi wouldn't tell me

25:41.800 --> 25:43.640
where Ignorance Demon
and the Decaying Immortal Pavilion are.

25:43.720 --> 25:45.480
He must be wary of me.

25:46.360 --> 25:47.920
Then we'll have to wait until tomorrow.

25:48.640 --> 25:50.560
Ignorance Demon will act.

25:50.640 --> 25:52.000
Once I pinpoint him,

25:52.080 --> 25:54.040
I'll take the chance to capture him.

26:07.520 --> 26:10.440
The succession ceremony begins!

26:29.240 --> 26:30.680
After my father's passing,

26:31.440 --> 26:33.760
the Immortal Alliance was left leaderless,
and the people have been restless.

26:34.840 --> 26:36.720
The five sects jointly decided

26:36.800 --> 26:38.360
that Saint Fajian of the Xuantian Sect

26:39.120 --> 26:40.240
would assume
the position of Alliance Leader.

26:43.360 --> 26:45.400
Saint Fajian, please.

26:52.480 --> 26:55.880
I was a close friend
of the late Alliance Leader Xie Daocheng

26:56.400 --> 26:59.120
and deeply understood that Leader Xie
was devoted to the welfare of the people.

26:59.200 --> 27:00.880
He worked tirelessly
to ensure the stability

27:00.960 --> 27:02.240
of the Immortal Alliance.

27:02.840 --> 27:03.840
Henceforth,

27:03.920 --> 27:06.280
I will devote myself wholeheartedly

27:06.360 --> 27:08.800
to continuing to prioritize
the people's welfare,

27:08.880 --> 27:10.440
upholding the prestige
of the Immortal Alliance,

27:10.520 --> 27:12.080
and solidifying its foundation.

27:17.080 --> 27:20.440
On behalf of the Snow City,
I congratulate the new Alliance Leader.

27:53.160 --> 27:56.360
Allow me to unlock the seal
on the Pearl Tower for you.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.440
Please follow me.

28:52.440 --> 28:54.360
All you need to do
is place the tokens inside,

28:54.440 --> 28:56.360
and the artifact will activate,

28:56.440 --> 28:58.720
allowing you to retrieve the Chaos Pearl.

29:22.280 --> 29:23.480
I had originally thought this tower

29:23.560 --> 29:25.840
was merely a container
for the Chaos Pearl,

29:26.800 --> 29:28.080
but it turns out

29:28.160 --> 29:30.920
the tower itself is an artifact.

29:31.720 --> 29:32.560
Indeed.

29:34.440 --> 29:36.920
My father knew there were those
who desired the Chaos Pearl,

29:37.000 --> 29:38.920
swearing to throw the world into chaos.

29:40.160 --> 29:41.880
To ensure its safety,

29:41.960 --> 29:43.760
he poured all his knowledge

29:45.200 --> 29:48.440
into transforming
the entire tower into an artifact.

30:16.760 --> 30:18.360
Xuanling, look!

30:18.440 --> 30:19.600
That's the Chaos Pearl!

30:19.680 --> 30:21.800
It's my first time seeing it too.
It's so beautiful.

30:22.400 --> 30:24.560
Truly worthy of being
an ancient divine artifact.

30:49.280 --> 30:50.840
The Chaos Pearl has left the Pearl Tower.

30:50.920 --> 30:52.200
The enemy watches from the shadows.

30:52.280 --> 30:53.200
This is not a place to linger.

30:53.800 --> 30:56.320
We shall escort the Chaos Pearl
back to the Xuantian Sect

30:56.920 --> 30:58.360
and secure it in the Eternal Stone Cave.

30:58.960 --> 31:00.120
It will be kept safe without fail.

31:01.280 --> 31:02.160
Sir, don't worry.

31:06.480 --> 31:07.320
Nan Xuyue!

31:31.520 --> 31:32.680
Everyone, remain calm.

31:33.280 --> 31:35.000
This is the Lofty Cloud Array,

31:35.080 --> 31:37.600
specially devised by Mr. Nan for today.

31:37.680 --> 31:40.800
Whether it's the Dark Clan
or a traitor within the Immortal Alliance,

31:40.880 --> 31:42.240
they cannot escape it.

31:43.120 --> 31:44.920
Mr. Xie, what is the meaning of this?

31:45.000 --> 31:47.120
The day I entered
the Immortals Array to repair the barrier,

31:47.200 --> 31:49.440
I was ambushed by a pre-planned trap
set by the Dark Clan.

31:49.960 --> 31:52.360
My father, at the Spiritual Form stage,
was secluded in the Snow City

31:52.440 --> 31:54.240
but was silently assassinated.

31:54.840 --> 31:57.320
This proves that among
the Alliance's top cultivators,

31:58.080 --> 31:59.880
there is a traitor
colluding with the Dark Abyss.

32:01.120 --> 32:02.640
Now, with the Dark Clan invading,

32:03.200 --> 32:05.120
their location remains hidden.

32:05.800 --> 32:07.560
Someone must be helping them hide.

32:07.640 --> 32:09.440
Their goal is the Chaos Pearl.

32:10.280 --> 32:12.200
Even if they have stayed still until now,

32:13.480 --> 32:15.080
they will surely act today.

32:16.720 --> 32:21.360
Sir, please recite the curse
with your disciples

32:21.880 --> 32:22.880
to first eliminate the Dark Clan.

32:23.520 --> 32:24.480
The curse?

32:25.000 --> 32:26.320
But I also bear demonic energy…

32:27.400 --> 32:28.400
No.

32:28.480 --> 32:30.160
Xie Xuechen did this on purpose.

32:31.720 --> 32:34.560
Another open scheme, luring the enemy out.

32:35.080 --> 32:38.080
If he were in the Dark Abyss,
he'd make a fine strategist.

32:38.880 --> 32:39.920
Mr. Xie's reasoning is sound.

32:40.520 --> 32:42.960
However, my disciples
recently used the curse

32:43.040 --> 32:45.720
for an extensive search
but found no trace of the Dark Clan.

32:45.800 --> 32:48.800
Trying again now
may yield the same result.

32:52.120 --> 32:55.120
That is precisely why I asked you all
to gather here.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.520
Within this Pearl Tower,

32:56.600 --> 32:58.640
my father set a mechanism
against the Dark Clan.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.600
With the Pearl Tower as the array's core,

33:00.680 --> 33:02.400
the Lofty Cloud Array

33:02.480 --> 33:05.480
can amplify the power of the curse
several times over.

33:06.080 --> 33:07.240
Sir,

33:09.040 --> 33:10.000
please recite the curse.

33:11.760 --> 33:12.600
Fine.

33:26.880 --> 33:28.600
-Ignorance Demon!
-Senior!

33:53.560 --> 33:54.400
Miss Mu!

34:19.159 --> 34:20.520
Among us,

34:20.600 --> 34:22.679
Saint Fajian has the most steadfast faith.

34:23.280 --> 34:24.199
No one could have imagined

34:24.280 --> 34:26.040
that even he would fall prey
to your Dark Clan invasion.

34:26.760 --> 34:28.639
A steadfast faith?

34:28.719 --> 34:29.719
Cultivators of the Immortal Alliance

34:29.800 --> 34:32.440
often believe that high cultivation
equates to a stable faith.

34:32.520 --> 34:35.000
You are wrong, completely wrong!

34:35.080 --> 34:37.159
Fajian harbors an obsession
with eliminating demons.

34:37.239 --> 34:39.639
But with his advanced age,
he increasingly worries

34:39.719 --> 34:41.000
about dying before
fulfilling his lifelong wish.

34:41.080 --> 34:43.040
The more he rushes to succeed,
the more unstable his faith becomes.

34:43.679 --> 34:46.000
He himself has realized this,

34:46.080 --> 34:48.639
however, it is too late.

34:48.719 --> 34:51.040
He can no longer resist
the demonic influence!

34:52.000 --> 34:53.480
You think that
by controlling Saint Fajian,

34:54.360 --> 34:55.960
you can seize the Chaos Pearl?

34:59.760 --> 35:01.600
Fajian has five centuries of cultivation.

35:01.680 --> 35:04.360
Aside from you, no one here is his match.

35:04.880 --> 35:08.080
But what a pity, you,
the once-greatest sword cultivator,

35:08.160 --> 35:09.520
now possess less than 40% of your power.

35:10.400 --> 35:13.040
Once I finish off you fools,

35:13.120 --> 35:15.040
taking the Chaos Pearl will be effortless!

35:18.440 --> 35:19.720
Xie Xuechen!

35:19.800 --> 35:20.680
Miss Mu!

35:21.360 --> 35:23.120
Miss Mu! Miss Mu!

35:27.200 --> 35:28.160
Miss Mu…

35:33.760 --> 35:37.000
Why is the demonic energy
suddenly fluctuating within her body?

35:47.400 --> 35:48.640
Yinian!

35:48.720 --> 35:50.120
-Are you okay?
-Mr. Xie.

35:50.200 --> 35:51.600
Senior has fallen into demonic possession,

35:51.680 --> 35:53.240
and I am powerless to stop him.

35:53.320 --> 35:56.280
The sect leaders
should be able to handle him.

35:56.360 --> 35:58.880
Mr. Xie, your spiritual power
has not fully recovered.

35:58.960 --> 36:01.480
It's better to hide
inside the Pearl Tower for now.

36:04.040 --> 36:06.600
Today, life and death are unpredictable,

36:06.680 --> 36:09.560
but the Chaos Pearl must never fall
into the hands of the Dark Clan.

36:10.400 --> 36:12.520
I'll escort the Chaos Pearl
back to the Xuantian Sect.

36:12.600 --> 36:15.520
The Eternal Stone Cave there
can block all evil influences.

36:16.120 --> 36:18.120
It will ensure the Chaos Pearl's safety.

36:20.480 --> 36:21.640
Do you think this battle

36:22.360 --> 36:24.160
is a guaranteed loss
for the Immortal Alliance,

36:25.080 --> 36:26.880
which is why you speak
such self-contradictory words?

36:29.480 --> 36:31.720
Mr. Xie, what do you mean?

36:35.680 --> 36:38.000
It was Saint Fajian
who discovered the Dark Clan

36:38.960 --> 36:42.000
and instructed Xuanxin to lead disciples
in a city-wide search using the curse.

36:42.960 --> 36:44.880
This proves he had not fallen
into demonic possession at the time.

36:45.680 --> 36:47.240
Given Saint Fajian's cultivation level,

36:47.320 --> 36:49.000
it would have taken Ignorance Demon

36:49.080 --> 36:50.960
far more than a moment
to possess him successfully.

36:51.040 --> 36:52.080
Thus,

36:52.680 --> 36:54.040
there's only one possibility.

36:54.640 --> 36:56.520
On that day, a powerful cultivator

36:56.600 --> 36:58.240
willingly allowed
Ignorance Demon to hide within him

36:58.760 --> 37:00.560
and later helped Ignorance Demon.

37:02.400 --> 37:03.680
Now it seems clear…

37:04.440 --> 37:06.280
It was you, Saint Yinian.

37:09.520 --> 37:11.960
Your spiritual power
has not fully recovered.

37:12.040 --> 37:14.680
So what if you figured it out?

37:14.760 --> 37:16.880
You've suspected me for some time, right?

37:18.000 --> 37:19.320
Not exactly.

37:20.360 --> 37:22.200
It was Ignorance Demon's exposure today

37:22.720 --> 37:26.720
that helped me piece it together.

37:28.120 --> 37:29.760
You guessed right.

37:29.840 --> 37:32.400
The night before, I debated with Senior.

37:32.480 --> 37:33.880
He noticed something unusual about me.

37:34.720 --> 37:37.560
But I was prepared,
binding him with an array

37:37.640 --> 37:39.120
and letting Ignorance Demon ambush him,

37:39.200 --> 37:41.880
slowly influencing his inner demons.

37:41.960 --> 37:42.800
It took an entire night

37:42.880 --> 37:44.800
to finally possess him.

37:48.560 --> 37:49.760
So,

37:49.840 --> 37:52.480
you were also the one
who opened the two-way array

37:53.440 --> 37:55.080
to let Ignorance Demon
into the Snow City that day?

37:56.240 --> 37:57.280
Yes.

37:57.920 --> 37:59.600
You killed my father?

38:05.200 --> 38:06.480
Why?

38:08.040 --> 38:09.200
You should know,

38:10.280 --> 38:11.720
even in death,

38:13.480 --> 38:15.760
he would never hand over
the Snow City's token.

38:15.840 --> 38:17.240
But only with his death,

38:17.760 --> 38:19.200
the position of Alliance Leader
would become vacant.

38:19.280 --> 38:20.680
The Alliance Leader…

38:21.920 --> 38:23.200
-Just for the position?
-Yes!

38:23.280 --> 38:25.080
I wanted Senior
to become the Alliance Leader.

38:26.600 --> 38:28.840
So, when Saint Fajian refused,

38:29.360 --> 38:31.520
you had Ignorance Demon possess him

38:31.600 --> 38:32.520
to make him agree on his behalf?

38:33.640 --> 38:35.080
If Senior were conscious,

38:35.160 --> 38:37.000
he would never agree
to become the Alliance Leader.

38:37.680 --> 38:39.560
This was my only option.

38:41.320 --> 38:42.840
Mr. Xie, you are a reasonable man.

38:42.920 --> 38:44.640
The Immortal Alliance
has already lost today.

38:45.240 --> 38:46.480
The Chaos Pearl is in my hands now.

38:47.200 --> 38:51.040
Why not open the barrier
and save your life in exchange?

38:52.040 --> 38:53.680
Do you think I fear death?

38:54.680 --> 38:57.400
If you didn't fear death,
why waste so many words with me?

38:57.480 --> 38:59.360
Naturally, to make you reveal more.

39:10.360 --> 39:12.000
Since I've set this trap today,

39:12.080 --> 39:14.000
do you think I'd use the real Chaos Pearl?

39:15.800 --> 39:17.240
When retrieving the Chaos Pearl earlier,

39:17.840 --> 39:19.600
I had already prepared a brilliant light.

39:29.160 --> 39:31.720
You used the brilliant light
as a distraction,

39:32.240 --> 39:33.840
swapping the real for a fake

39:34.600 --> 39:35.680
to deceive me?

39:35.760 --> 39:37.200
Perhaps you didn't know,

39:37.280 --> 39:39.080
but the Greenview Heights
has a type of spirit bead

39:40.040 --> 39:41.280
called the Amplifying Bead.

39:45.400 --> 39:46.920
You…

39:47.000 --> 39:48.880
You let everyone hear our conversation?

39:48.960 --> 39:51.320
After all this guessing,
the traitor turns out to be Yinian!

39:51.400 --> 39:53.760
So what if you all know?

39:53.840 --> 39:56.000
Xie Xuechen's spiritual power
is less than 40%.

39:56.080 --> 39:58.320
With just a few of you,
you cannot stop me.

39:58.400 --> 39:59.920
Stop wasting time.

40:00.520 --> 40:01.640
Let's settle this quickly!

40:07.640 --> 40:08.680
-Father! Mother!
-Don't come over!

40:08.760 --> 40:10.000
Master!

40:18.440 --> 40:20.520
Boundless Mountain!

40:25.720 --> 40:29.040
That's Fajian's ultimate move,
Boundless Mountain.

40:29.640 --> 40:32.480
Once unleashed, no one can rival it…

41:17.720 --> 41:20.800
Mr. Xie's spiritual power
has been restored!
